  <p class="src-bhashyam"><span class="src-pratika">sā hovāca maitreyī </span>| evamuktā pratyuvāca maitreyī — yadyevaṃ <span class="src-pratika">yenāhaṃ nāmṛtā syām , kimahaṃ tena </span>vittena <span class="src-pratika">kuryām </span>? <span class="src-pratika">yadeva </span>bhagavān kevalam amṛtatva-sādhanaṃ <span class="src-pratika">veda</span>, <span class="src-pratika">tadeva </span>amṛtatva-sādhanaṃ <span class="src-pratika">me </span>mahyaṃ <span class="src-pratika">brūhi </span>॥</p>
  <p class="src-bhashyam">sa hovāca yājñavalkyaḥ priyā batāre naḥ satī priyaṃ bhāṣasa ehyāssva vyākhyāsyāmi te vyācakṣāṇasya tu me nididhyāsasveti ॥ 2-4-4 ॥</p>
  <p class="src-bhashyam">sa hovāca yājñavalkyaḥ | evaṃ vitta-sādhye'mṛtatva-sādhane pratyākhyāte, yājñavalkyaḥ svābhiprāya-sampattau tuṣṭa āha — <span class="src-pratika">sa hovāca </span>— <span class="src-pratika">priyā </span>iṣṭā, <span class="src-pratika">bata </span>ityanukampyāha, <span class="src-pratika">are </span>maitreyi, <span class="src-pratika">na </span>asmākaṃ <span class="src-pratika">pūrvamapi priyā satī </span>bhavantī idānīṃ <span class="src-pratika">priyam </span>eva cittānukūlaṃ <span class="src-pratika">bhāṣase </span>| ataḥ <span class="src-pratika">ehi āssva </span>upaviśa <span class="src-pratika">vyākhyāsyāmi </span>— yat <span class="src-pratika">te </span>tava iṣṭam amṛtatva-sādhanamātma-jñānam kathayiṣyāmi | <span class="src-pratika">vyācakṣāṇasya </span>tu me mama vyākhyānaṃ kurvataḥ, <span class="src-pratika">nididhyāsasva </span>vākyāni arthato niścayena dhyātumiccheti ॥</p>
  <p class="src-bhashyam">2-4-5</p>
  <p class="src-bhashyam">sa hovāca na vā are patyuḥ kāmāya patiḥ priyo bhavatyātmanastu kāmāya patiḥ priyo bhavati | na vā are jāyāyai kāmāya jāyā priyā bhavatyātmanastu kāmāya jāyā priyā bhavati | na vā are putrāṇāṃ kāmāya putrāḥ priyā bhavantyātmanastu kāmāya putrāḥ priyā bhavanti | na vā are vittasya kāmāya vittaṃ priyaṃ bhavatyātmanastu kāmāya vittaṃ priyaṃ bhavati | na vā are brahmaṇaḥ kāmāya brahma priyaṃ bhavatyātmanastu kāmāya brahma priyaṃ bhavati | na vā are kṣatrasya kāmāya kṣatraṃ priyaṃ bhavatyātmanastu kāmāya kṣatraṃ priyaṃ bhavati | na vā are lokānāṃ kāmāya lokāḥ priyā bhavantyātmanastu kāmāya lokāḥ priyā bhavanti | na vā are devānāṃ kāmāya devāḥ priyā bhavantyātmanastu kāmāya devāḥ priyā bhavanti | na vā are bhūtānāṃ kāmāya bhūtāni priyāṇi bhavantyātmanastu kāmāya bhūtāni priyāṇi bhavanti | na vā are sarvasya kāmāya sarvaṃ priyaṃ bhavatyātmanastu kāmāya sarvaṃ priyaṃ bhavati | ātmā vā are draṣṭavyaḥ śrotavyo mantavyo nididhyāsitavyo maitreyyātmano vā are darśanena śravaṇena matyā vijñānenedaṃ sarvaṃ viditam ॥ 2-4-5 ॥</p>
  <p class="src-bhashyam"><span class="src-pratika">sa hovāca </span>— amṛtatvasādhanaṃ vairāgyamupadidikṣuḥ jāyāpatiputrādibhyo virāgamutpādayati tatsannyāsāya |</p>
  <p class="src-bhashyam"><span class="src-pratika">na vai </span>— vai - śabdaḥ prasiddhasmaraṇārthaḥ ; prasiddhameva etat loke ; <span class="src-pratika">patyuḥ </span>bhartuḥ <span class="src-pratika">kāmāya </span>prayojanāya <span class="src-pratika">jāyāyāḥ patiḥ priyo </span>na bhavati, kiṃ tarhi <span class="src-pratika">ātmanastu kāmāya </span>prayojanāyaiva bhāryāyāḥ <span class="src-pratika">patiḥ priyo bhavati </span>| tathā <span class="src-pratika">na vā are jāyāyā </span>ityādi samānamanyat , <span class="src-pratika">na vā are putrāṇām </span>, <span class="src-pratika">na vā are vittasya</span>, <span class="src-pratika">na vā are brahmaṇaḥ</span>, <span class="src-pratika">na vā are kṣatrasya</span>, <span class="src-pratika">na vā are lokānām </span>, <span class="src-pratika">na vā are devānām </span>, <span class="src-pratika">na vā are bhūtānām , na vā are sarvasya </span>| pūrvaṃ pūrvaṃ yathāsanne prītisādhane vacanam , tatra tatra iṣṭataratvādvairāgyasya ; sarvagrahaṇam uktānuktārtham | tasmāt lokaprasiddhametat — ātmaiva priyaḥ, nānyat |<span class="src-note-blue">‘tadetatpreyaḥ putrāt’ (bṛ. u. 1 | 4 | 8) </span>ityupanyastam , tasyaitat vṛttisthānīyaṃ prapañcitam | tasmāt ātma-prīti-sādhanatvāt gauṇī anyatra prītiḥ, ātmanyeva mukhyā | tasmāt <span class="src-pratika">ātmā vai are draṣṭavyaḥ </span>darśanārhaḥ, darśana-viṣayamāpādayitavyaḥ <span class="src-pratika">śrotavyaḥ </span>pūrvam ācāryata āgamataśca ; paścānma<span class="src-pratika">ntavyaḥ </span>tarkataḥ ; tato <span class="src-pratika">nididhyāsitavyaḥ </span>niścayena dhyātavyaḥ ; evaṃ hyasau dṛṣṭo bhavati śravaṇa-manana-nididhyāsana-sādhanairnirvartitaiḥ | yadā ekatvametānyupagatāni, tadā samyagdarśanaṃ brahmaikatva-viṣayaṃ prasīdati, na anyathā śravaṇamātreṇa |yat brahma-kṣatrādi-karma-nimittaṃ varṇāśramādi-lakṣaṇam ātmanyavidyādhyāropita-pratyaya-viṣayaṃ kriyā-kāraka-phalātmakam avidyā-pratyaya-viṣayam — rajjvāmiva sarpapratyayaḥ, tadupamardanārthamāha — ātmani khalu are maitreyi dṛṣṭe śrute mate vijñāte <span class="src-pratika">idaṃ sarvaṃ viditaṃ </span>vijñātaṃ bhavati ॥</p>
  <p class="src-mulam">Vartika verses on 2-4-5 - Vairagyam - Need and understanding</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">ā brahmaṇo'smātsaṃsārācchuddhadhīrna virajyate ||<br>yāvattāvanna vidyāyā adhikārī bhavennaraḥ || 2-4-71 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">vairāgyahetāvapyasminrakto dharmādihetutaḥ ||<br>yato'taḥ karmaśuddhātmā bhavādasmādvirajyate || 72 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">vairāgyahetūnsaṃsāre tasmādyatnādiyaṃ śrutiḥ ||<br>na vā ara iti hyuktyā vaktuṃ samupacakrame || 73 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">yasminneva parā saktistasminneva nirādaram ||<br>karma kṛtvā paraṃ yatnādanyasyārthayate phalam || 74 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">kimikṣo rasamāpnoti yatnānniṣpīḍayanna nā ||<br>75 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">śītamalpaṃ sukhaṃ grīṣme tāpo'lpaḥ śiśire sukham ||<br>tadeva duḥkhakṛdbhūri taddhetvoranavasthiteḥ || 77 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">śabdo'sti na priyaḥ kaścidapriyo vā svatastathā ||<br>raktadviṣṭamano hetuḥ śabdādyarthe priyāpriye || 78 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">svato'khilo'priyo'nātmā pratyaṅmohaikahetutaḥ ||<br>pratyagāhlādakāritvādapriyo'pi priyo mataḥ || 79 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">jāyādirapriyaḥ sarvaḥ svata ādyantaduḥkhakṛt ||<br>taddhetorātmanaḥ prīterjāyādiḥ priya ucyate || 80 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">na kasyāṃcidavasthāyāmātmā loke'priyo mataḥ ||<br>priyo'priyaśca jāyādiryathā'nātmā muhurmuhuḥ || 81 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">svata evāpriyo'nātmā hyātmaprītyarthasādhanāt ||<br>jāyādiḥ syātpriyo bhaktyā bandhakyāḥ kāmuko yathā || 82 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">nirhaitukī svataḥ prītirātmanyeva yatastataḥ ||<br>bhāktaṃ priyaṃ parityajya mukhyaṃ priyamupāśrayet || 83 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">kṣayāntā nicayāḥ sarve patanāntāḥ samucchrayāḥ ||<br>saṃyogā viprayogāntā maraṇāntaṃ ca jīvitam || 84 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">na tadasti sukhaṃ loke yanna duḥkhakaraṃ bhavet ||<br>tadasaṃprāptivicchedakṣayeṣvasukhakṛdyataḥ || 85 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">evaṃ cetsādhanodbhūtaṃ yāvatkiṃcitsukhaṃ matam ||<br>tanniḥśeṣaṃ parityajya sukhamātyantikaṃ śrayet || 86 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">sāṃsārikasukhasyāsya duḥkhatvāduktahetutaḥ ||<br>niṣkṛṣyātastataḥ prītiṃ pratīcyeva niveśayet || 87 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">sraji daṇḍādayo yadvatsragajñānaikahetukāḥ ||<br>patijāyāsutādyevaṃ pratyagajñānahetujam || 88 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">sarvānarthanivṛttiśca sarvāhlādāptireva ca ||<br>pratīci jñānamātrāccettadanyatprārthyate katham || 89 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">yasya saṃbandhamāśritya hyapriyo'pi priyāyate ||<br>priyo'pyapriyatāṃ yāti yasya saṃgatikāraṇāt || 90 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">dṛṣṭvā'nubhavatastattvamātmānātmapadārthayoḥ ||<br>upāditsā jihāsā ca tatkṛtaivānupālyatām || 91 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">nānāprākāra āsaṅgo viṣakto yo'sya bāhyataḥ ||<br>yathoktakāraṇātsarvaṃ pratīcyeva niveśayet || 92 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">narakādiva nirviṇṇo yāvannā'' brahmaṇo naraḥ ||<br>na tāvadadhikāro'sti kaivalyajñānavartmani || 93 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">sarvāsaṅgavinirmukto mokṣamātraprayojanaḥ ||<br>ato'dhikriyate pratyagjñānotpattau na rāgavān || 94 ||</p>
  <p class="src-mulam">What does ātmā mean?What does draṣṭavya mean?</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">ātmā pratyakprasiddheḥ syāttatraivā''tmānubhūtitaḥ ||<br>iti prameyanirdeśo draṣṭavya iti tatpramā || 95 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">ātmabuddhiriyaṃ tāvatsarveṣāṃ jāyate svataḥ ||<br>aprāptā sarvamātmeti saivāto dhīrvidhīyate || 96 ||</p>
  <p class="src-mulam">Can draṣṭavya be a vidhi, an injunction?</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">draṣṭṛdraṣṭavyayorbhede satyevaṃ dhīrvidhīyate ||<br>niyojyaviṣayābhede ghaṭate na vidhiryataḥ || 97 ||</p>
  <p class="src-mulam">Vedanta teaches non dual ātmā  - niyojya-viṣaya-abheda - so vidhi is not tenable</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">uttarottarabhūyāṃsi nāmādīni yathākramam ||<br>upanyasyā''tmayāthātmyaṃ tattatvaṃ prābravīcchrutiḥ || 98 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">bhūmnaśca lakṣaṇaṃ cakre yatra nānyaditi svayam ||<br>atha yatreti cālpasya prāṇāntasya ca lakṣaṇam || 99 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">athāta iti vākyena hyahameveti niściteḥ ||<br>niṣidhyānātmarūpaṃ yattato'haṃkāranihnutiḥ || 100 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">ātmaivetyādivākyena pūrṇabrahmāvabodhinā ||<br>nāvidhvastaṃ tamo'to'sti na ca jñānamanutthitam || 101 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">nānivṛttastathā'nartho nānavāptaṃ sukhaṃ tathā ||<br>kāryajñeyasamāptiḥ syātpratyagyāthātmyabodhataḥ || 102 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">sarvāsūpaniṣatsvevaṃ pramātrāderanātmanaḥ ||<br>pratyaṅmātraikayāthātmyaṃ śrūyate sopapattikam || 103 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">ihāpi neti vākyena pratīco'tatsvabhāvakam ||<br>vyutthāpitamanūdyā''ha sarvamātmeti naḥ śrutiḥ || 104 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">bhāvābhāvātmanā sthānaṃ na niṣedhyasya vastunaḥ ||<br>yato'taḥ sarvamātmaiva prābravīcchrutirañjasā || 105 ||</p>
  <p class="src-bhashyam">When an injunction is tenable?</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">svātanryaṃ yatra kartuḥ syāttatra kartā niyujyate ||<br>anvayavyatirekābhyāmātmānātmavivecane || 107 ||</p>
  <p class="src-mulam">How a sentence is understood?</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">vacorthapratibodhasya padārthājñānameva tu ||<br>yato'ntarāyastaddhānau tena tatra niyujyate || 108 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">evaṃ jñāta-padārthaḥ sanyathā pūrvamavādiṣam ||<br>brahma vā idamityatra nyāyenaikātmyayāyinā || 109 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">nirantarāyo vākyārthaṃ vākyādevāvagacchati ||<br>avyāvṛttānanugata-pratyaktattva-samīkṣaṇāt || 110 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">nityamuktatva-vijñānaṃ vākyādevāñjasā bhavet ||<br>vākyārthasya ca vijñānaṃ padārthasmṛtipūrvakam || 111 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">anvayavyatirekābhyāṃ padārthaḥ smaryate dhruvam ||<br>evaṃ nirduḥkhamātmānamakriyaṃ pratipadyate || 112 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">pratyaṅmohodbhavānātma-prādhānyena tamonvayāt ||<br>ātmā''tmānaṃ purā'jñāsīdvākyārthajñānajanmataḥ || 113 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">anātmano'ta ātmānam anvayavyatirekataḥ ||<br>niṣkṛṣyā''tmanyathā''tmānaṃ sarvamātmeti paśyati || 114 ||</p>
  <p class="src-mulam">Vidhi is purely making what is unknown known , not impelling some action</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">ajñātajñāpanaṃ cāto vidhiratrābhidhīyate ||<br>apravṛttapravṛttiśca nyāyābhāvānna yujyate || 115 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">nityaṃ na bhavanaṃ yasya yasya vā nityabhūtatā ||<br>na tasya kriyamāṇatvaṃ khapuppākāśayoriva || 116 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">utpattyādi svato yasya yasya cātyantameva na ||<br>kriyānapekṣasiddhatvātsvataḥsiddhaṃ taducyate || 117 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">ato'puruṣatantratvānnā''tmajñāne vidhirbhavet ||<br>anvayādikriyā tvasya tattantratvādvidhīyate || 121 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">śravaṇaṃ mananaṃ tadvattathā śamadamādi yat ||<br>pumāñśaknoti tatkartuṃ tasmādetadvidhīyate || 122 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">pramāṇamapramāṇaṃ ca pramābhāsaṃ ca yadbhavet ||<br>caitanyākāramevaitatprathate sarvameva tat || 124 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">nānākārānupādatte caitanyākārameva sat ||<br>pratīcyavyabhicāryekaṃ tadanye vyabhicāriṇaḥ || 125 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika">mātrādivyabhicāre'pi saṃvidavyabhicāriṇī ||<br>mithaḥ kṛtsne'pi jagati tadanyadvyabhicāri tu || 126 ||</p>
  <p class="src-mulam">Vartikasara verses</p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">abhicāreṇa putrādau yā prītistāṃ vicārataḥ ||<br></p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">ātmanyevopasaṃhṛtya citaikāgryaṃ vivarddhayet ||<br>25 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">aikāgryamacalaṃ kṛtvā nididhyāsanakāraṇam ||<br></p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">ātmā draṣṭavya ityetatsūtraṃ vyākhyātumādade ||<br>26 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">āhātmaśabdaḥ pratyañcaṃ tathā loke'nubhūtitaḥ ||<br></p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">anenātmātmaśabdena prameyaṃ nirdidikṣitam ||<br>27 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">draṣṭavya iti nirdiṣṭā prāmitidarśitā'dhunā ||<br></p>
