  <p class="src-vartika-sara">ajñāta ātmā vedāntajanyajñānena mīyate ||<br></p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">ityevaiṣo'tra vākyārtho nāpravṛttapravartanam ||<br>29 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">nanvahaṃpratyayenātmā vedāntaśravaṇātpurā ||<br></p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">vijñāta iti cet, maivaṃ, sārvātmyānavabodhanāt ||<br>30 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">liṅgadehaparicchedarūpagrāhiṇyahaṃmātiḥ ||<br></p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">sārvātmyamātmanastatvaṃ tadajñātamahaṃdhiyā ||<br>31 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">sarvāsūpaniṣatsvetatsārvātmyaṃ pratipādyate ||<br></p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">kāryajñeyasamāptiḥ syātsārvātmyasyāvabodhataḥ ||<br>32 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">nāvidhvastaṃ tamo'trāsti naca jñānamanutthitama ||<br></p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">nānivṛttastathā'nartho nānavāptaṃ sukhaṃ tathā ||<br>33 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">ityajñātajñāpanākhyo vidhiratropavarṇitaḥ ||<br></p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">apravṛttapravṛtyākhyo vidhirnātropapadyate ||<br>34 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">vidheyaṃ vā phalaṃ vā'sya na sambhavati kiñcana ||<br></p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">brahma-taddhī-stadabhyāsa upāyo vā vidhīyatām ||<br>35 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">na brahma nityasiddhatvādvidhātuṃ śakyate kiñcit ||<br></p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">abhūtabhāvi-yāgādirvidhimarhati netaraḥ ||<br>36 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">nityaṃ na bhavanaṃ yasya yasya vā nityabhūtatā ||<br></p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">na tayorvidhi-yogyatvaṃ khapuṣpākāśayoriva ||<br>37 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">taddhīrvidheyetyasmiṃśca pakṣe dhīḥ ketikathyatām ||<br></p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">antaḥkaraṇavṛttirvā kiṃvā tatphalavedanam ||<br>38 ||</p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">vṛttiḥ pratyakcidākārā kiṃvā sārvātmyagocarā ||<br></p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">ādye vidhirapūrvo vā niyamo vā'thavetaraḥ ||<br>39 ||</p>
  <p class="src-note-blue">{</p>
  <p class="src-note-blue">Vidhi classification in mimamsa shastra as apūrva, niyama, parisaṃkhyā -</p>
  <p class="src-note-blue">vidhiratyantamaprāptau niyamaḥ pākṣike sati |</p>
  <p class="src-note-blue">tatra cā'nyatra ca prāptau parisaṃkhyeti gīyate ||</p>
  <p class="src-note-blue">}</p>
  <p class="src-vartika-sara">pratyakcidākāratāyāḥ prāptatvānnāstyapūrvatā ||<br></p>
